Lineamode Apparel is an end-to-end clothing manufacturer that provides expertise and solutions from design to production with specializations in knitwear garments made of performance polyesters. As a B2B fashion partner we operate with a core focus on agility and innovation to develop well-engineered product that meets the needs of global trends in an ever-evolving consumer landscape.
The range of services we offer include design support and product development to facilitate trend forecasting, collection planning, prototyping, and merchandising. Our digital processes and teams help ensure best practices are followed to ensure the best quality with commercial viability. As a manufacturer, we help creative ideas become reality with pursuing operational efficiency and flexibility to be responsive to the needs and requirements of our customers. This helps us handle a variety of designs and manage low MOQ orders to mitigate inventory risks most brands experience when growing their business.

 
Brand Manifesto
Fashion businesses and supply chains operate in an increasingly complex world in which issues a brand experiences from a supplier include inadequate product quality, overproduction, poor coordination and long lead times. There is a constant pressure to be efficient and reduce cost without compromising on the brand – and this is becoming more difficult in a consumer landscape that is always evolving with new trends.
Lineamode Apparel was established with the purpose of helping brands address these problems by providing end-to-end solutions with expertise in each process to ensure product quality, responsiveness and effective planning. Our goal is to be your partner to help grow and expand your brand successfully.

 
Brand Values
Lineamode Apparel is guided by a set of core values that shape its operations and client relationships.
Innovation
We focus on investing in the best tools, technologies, and practices to deliver the best product quality with elevated designs.
Operational Agility
Our lean supply chain and short lead times support rapid product launches and give global brands the flexibility to manage inventories effectively.
Design Forward & Research Driven
Our research and thinking are led by global trends helping our teams build the awareness and capabilities to convert trends to commercially successful products.
Collaborative Partnership
We act as a dedicated partner to help buyers grow their range through technical support and design development in a collaborative environment.
Technical Competence
Our organization’s DNA stems from 30+ years of experience in the global textile industry, with exposure from working with the best brands and manufacturers in fashion.

 
Tone of Voice
The communication style of Lineamode Apparel should reflect the company expertise and technical competence in the fashion industry. We speak as a design led innovation partner that understands the intersection of global trends and manufacturing precision. All brand communication must maintain clarity and precision while presenting the company as a trusted partner for global fashion labels. Our voice is rooted in narrative and built on collaboration which means we prioritize clear and bold messaging that highlights our methodical approach to product development.
